{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.poster.avif?t=1757709540\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141810/extras/da8b916117050bf1aa5b79cbbfd5aac4.webm?t=1757709540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Through Endless Hordes of Enemies!</strong> <br>Get ready for non-stop action in this fast-paced top-down arcade shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Your Gun. Power It Up. Wipe 'Em Out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide arsenal of unique weapons and dive into intense twin-stick mayhem. Whether you like rapid-fire chaos, explosive blasts, or precise sharpshooting, there\u2019s a gun for your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Gold. Power Up Your Build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold by taking down hordes of enemies and leveling up to choose from a wide variety of upgrades, ranging from common upgrades to gun-specific upgrades. Mix and match your gun, gun mods, and upgrades to create explosive, over-the-top combos that dominate the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udfaf <i>Fast-paced twin-stick action</i> \u2013 Move, shoot, and survive in top-down chaos.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <i>15+ unique weapons</i> \u2013 From classics to experimental tech, every gun feels and plays different.<br>\u26a1 <i>30+ gun mods</i> \u2013 Equip up to 3 gun mods to customize your playstyle each run.<br>\ud83d\ude80 <i>80+ upgrades</i> \u2013 Stack upgrades to unleash over-the-top combos.<br>\ud83d\udd52 <i>Multiple game modes</i> \u2013 Go for a timed survival run or fight through wave-based challenges.<br>\ud83d\udd25 <i>Endless replayability</i> \u2013 Try new gun + mod combos every time you play!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawn Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/ff335ea26252e248e8dd7da71dd5f425a56c4469.jpg"},{"name":"Cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/56d4d17c691cfe71b7435764081a16c7d9ab5771.jpg"},{"name":"First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/fd4157707b43eaaca78f184b34f083e6b9b3adaa.jpg"},{"name":"Pistol - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/a4f8c3307d0b62ed37812dd8f1d670d103c1284f.jpg"},{"name":"Shotgun - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/8524d0330a591ee79a1b2f27ffa82f796b79b283.jpg"},{"name":"Crossbow - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/c287a44856d3cd94cd36d86b17d5edc888f25041.jpg"},{"name":"Machinegun - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/3789f9c6410fbcf0611df620ba14c3f8b8d7c965.jpg"},{"name":"SMG - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/61034769c0d7bcad5b6594c0373fa6a09f8192f0.jpg"},{"name":"Burst Carbine - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/a765d557f416831bb324a91532ae4f8bcc43ee6c.jpg"},{"name":"Grenade Launcher - First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141810/50ca49ae63232468652087be653adbe1338cc283.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141810?t=1757709540","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st